{"2878580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Key Fairy", "steam_appid": 2878580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the forest... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.webm?t=1780975588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.mp4?t=1780975588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frenetic Pacifist Engagements... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits, wiles, and grappling thread to collect the shattered stars of lost monsters, hungry beasts, and forgotten gods, fallen prey to fear and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Twisting Paths... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind your way through forgotten forests, coursing rivers, slimy marshlands, dripping caves, and unstable towers, under the endless eyes of what look like stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Strange Folk... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trinkets, discuss riddles, learn secrets, solve dreams, and help the denizens of the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn &amp; Hand-Crafted... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure made just for you! We forged this forest out of blood, and ink, and thought. Come, join us for a while, we are only small, and there is space enough to share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forest Contains... </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, frenetic engagements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets by the bagful, for you to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hand-crafted rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People, with hopes and dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A litany of not-quite endings, one ending, and one proper ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds (if you walk softly, you may hear them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ungodly quantity of keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pages and pages of hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sword! (not to be used as a weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No secrets. <i>we promise there are no secrets in the forest...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the forest... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.webm?t=1780975588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.mp4?t=1780975588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frenetic Pacifist Engagements... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits, wiles, and grappling thread to collect the shattered stars of lost monsters, hungry beasts, and forgotten gods, fallen prey to fear and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Twisting Paths... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind your way through forgotten forests, coursing rivers, slimy marshlands, dripping caves, and unstable towers, under the endless eyes of what look like stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Strange Folk... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trinkets, discuss riddles, learn secrets, solve dreams, and help the denizens of the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn &amp; Hand-Crafted... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure made just for you! We forged this forest out of blood, and ink, and thought. Come, join us for a while, we are only small, and there is space enough to share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forest Contains... </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, frenetic engagements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets by the bagful, for you to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hand-crafted rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People, with hopes and dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A litany of not-quite endings, one ending, and one proper ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds (if you walk softly, you may hear them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ungodly quantity of keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pages and pages of hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sword! (not to be used as a weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No secrets. <i>we promise there are no secrets in the forest...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.gif?t=1780975588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.poster.avif?t=1780975588\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>", "short_description": "Deep in an ancient forest bound by a bitter spell, a tiny fairy wanders. Wielding a spool of thread and a bladeless sword, weave through twisting paths to unearth enchanted trinkets, evading monsters and collecting stars to free their hearts from hatred in this ink-illustrated pacifist bullet-hell.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Key Fairy's forest is a place I want to live, and I'm very grateful for even a short opportunity to spend time in it.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“I will return to Key Fairy, to remind myself that I too am a little fish in a big pond, full of creatures who want to be nice but need a little help. I will return to hear tales and songs, to wander off the path, to get wonderfully hopelessly lost, but ultimately find my way again.”<br>9/10 – SIFTER<br><br>“I can’t and won’t spoil the game’s final encounter, but on both a gameplay and presentation level, it was one of my favourite boss fights in recent history. Truly, it’s something special. [...] Easily one of my favourite games I’ve played in a hot minute, unique doesn’t even begin to describe how one-of-a-kind this title truly is.”<br>9/10 – WellPlayed<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/aaeff2f467be1dbeb2605e5697f83625c4fdbf1c/header.jpg?t=1780975588", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/0ab642d1b4a0d5409eb4ce7c3ec0344f1455f56b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780975588", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/0ab642d1b4a0d5409eb4ce7c3ec0344f1455f56b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780975588", "website": "https://keyfairy.com.au/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</st